\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Strengthens on  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Swap Announcement\b0\par\par\uc2 470 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Juni 2012\par 21:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Real strengthens after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announces swap auction for Friday\par \par \uc2 --Auction will be third this week, $6 billion in swaps already sold\par \par \uc2 --Brazilian real exits active trading at BRL2.0823 to the dollar\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Brian Asher \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RIO DE JANEIRO--The Brazilian real strengthened in late trading Thursday after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced its third \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the week, a $3 billion dollar-swap auction set to be held Friday morning.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real exited active trading at BRL2.0823 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, slightly stronger than Wednesday's close at BRL2.0844 to the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real had traded as weak as BRL2.0950 to the dollar Thursday, as persistent weakening pressures have dragged the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  down.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Thursday morning, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold $3 billion worth of dollar-swap contracts, its second such auction this week.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But the auction had little effect, as many banks used it only to roll over expiring swap contracts, traders said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 European officials Thursday hinted they may not be ready to sign any accord by the end of their summit on Friday, reinforcing fears of prolonged global economic distress and strengthening the dollar against most \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Also weakening the real was a series of discouraging data releases in Brazil this week, where domestic growth is now forecast at just 2.18% for the year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But the announcement of Friday's auction immediately strengthened the real in the spot market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Apparently, today's announcement was far more effective than Wednesday's announcement," said Reginaldo Galhardo, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  manager at the Treviso brokerage in Sao Paulo. "The real has been weakened by bad news in the U.S. and Europe, but also by the new economic reality here in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . We'll see if this \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can have a lasting effect or if the real goes back to its previous course."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Other traders predicted that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue as long as demand for dollars remains high.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The real is going to continue to weaken until there is less demand for dollars," said Marcos Trabbold, chief of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at BT Associates brokerage in Sao Paulo. "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold 100% of the swap contracts it offered today and Wednesday. With that much demand for dollars, the real keeps depreciating, so I expect the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to offer swap contracts until it finds it can't sell them all, and then you'll see the real stabilize."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Also unique this week has been the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's decision to announce auctions with one day's notice.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Previously, auctions were announced and held the same day, but most traders find that the new tactic has little effect on the market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Brian Asher at brian.asher@dowjones.com [ 28-06-12 1949GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120628e86s0015d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
