\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Opens Stronger Despite Euro-Zone Pessimism\b0\par\par\uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2012\par 15:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Brazil \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthens, decoupling from euro\par \par \uc2 --Investors expecting continued uncertainty in Europe\par \par \uc2 --Real trading at BRL2.0636 to the dollar at 1215 GMT\par \par \uc2 By Brian Asher\par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO--The Brazilian real opened stronger Tuesday morning despite a widely held view that the European summit on Thursday and Friday will bring none of the measures needed to restore confidence in the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL2.0636 to the dollar as of 1215 GMT, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, slightly stronger than Monday's close at BRL2.0654 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  decoupled from the weakening euro, a rare occurrence since investors have generally fled emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at times when the European crisis has intensified.\par \par \uc2 Traders noted that exporters typically sell dollars to the market when the real edges toward the BRL2.07 mark. But the European crisis could bring the real down again later in the week.\par \par \uc2 Spain and Italy each saw sharply rising borrowing costs in debt auctions early Tuesday, bringing new doubts over the survival of the euro at a time when pessimism regarding the ability of European leaders to resolve the crisis is at an all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Adding to the gloom was the downgrade of 28 Spanish banks by \uc2 Moody's\uc2  Investor Services late Monday.\par \par \uc2 Most analysts and investors are predicting that this week's summit will produce no concrete results, as Germany will continue to demand greater political union in exchange for any banking or fiscal union.\par \par \uc2 "The expectation for the European summit is for nothing new," said Sidnei Nehme, director and owner of the NGO Brokerage in Sao Paulo. "Maybe it will be a step forward, but I don't see a short-term resolution to the European crisis."\par \par \uc2 U.S. economic data due to be released Tuesday afternoon may distract markets briefly, but Europe is expected to remain the focus of the financial world for the rest of the week.\par \par \uc2 The real recently has traded in a narrow band between BRL2.03 and BRL2.07 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Previously, the real had swung wildly at times, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with dollar-swap contracts to stem the depreciation of the real.\par \par \uc2 After trading as high as BRL1.70 to the dollar in February, the real has depreciated to its current level as the euro-zone crisis intensifies and worries over slowing growth in Brazil itself persist.\par \par \uc2 But Nehme said he believes a comparatively narrow range will persist. "I see the real trading between BRL2.00 and BRL2.10 to the dollar for the rest of the year," he said. "In addition to the European crisis, the perceptions of growth here are worse all the time. We're going to have low growth this year."\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's survey of economists revealed that the average forecast for 2012 economic growth had fallen for the seventh consecutive week, now down to 2.18%.\par \par \uc2 Later Monday, investors will watch closely as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  publishes May credit data.\par \par \uc2 A key concern in Brazil has been rising consumer loan defaults, and fresh signs of a bursting consumer credit bubble that could negatively affect markets.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Brian Asher at brian.asher@dowjones.com [ 26-06-12 1305GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120626e86q000sq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
