\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Fraga:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Wants To Avoid 2008 'Mini-Panic'\b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 2012\par 16:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has shown that it isn't targeting a specific level for \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real, and only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to avoid turbulence, said Arminio Fraga, a former president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and now the head of \uc2 Gavea Investimentos Ltda\uc2 , one of Brazil's largest hedge funds.\par \par \uc2 "With regards to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has in general shown that it doesn't have a target for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Mr. Fraga said at an event. "It doesn't like turbulence. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't want a mini panic such as the one in 2008. I continue to think that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't have a target for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 The executive was referring to the sharp depreciation of the Brazilian real in the wake of the collapse of U.S. investment bank \uc2 Lehman Brothers\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent months, prompting a debate over the ultimate objectives. Some argue that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pegged at a certain level, while others argue that it's just avoiding volatility.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself denies that it has a target level for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and says it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ensure the proper functioning of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rogerio Jelmayer at rogerio.jelmayer@dowjones.com [ 19-06-12 1514GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120619e86j000tt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
