\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 , Debt Flat, But Investors Are Nervous\b0\par\par\uc2 By Prabha Natarajan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 343 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2012\par 21:11\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bonds had another day of up and down moves, but headed into the holiday weekend a tad stronger on the day.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took the opportunity to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  once again and push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to further strength against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, emerging-market bond funds had net outflows for the first time in 19 weeks, according to EPFR Global's latest weekly data as of Wednesday. Outflows during the week totaled $478 million.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in New York trading, \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw some turbulence when the head of Spain's Catalonia region called for the central government to accelerate plans to share responsibility for regional debt because of increasing difficulties the regions face to finance themselves, while stressing his region will meet its financial commitments.\par \par \uc2 "Investors are still very nervous going into the weekend," said Win Thin, head of emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The dollar ended the day 1.56% lower at BRL1.9980, according to CQG data. Market participants say the real could go on a corrective drive and strengthen some more, but expect global weakness to push the dollar back to BRL2.06-BRL2.07.\par \par \uc2 Other key emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  like the Mexican peso and Turkish lira were mostly unchanged.\par \par \uc2 Emerging-market debt was flat. The \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2  Emerging Market Bond Index Global was 1 basis points wider at 407 basis points over comparable Treasury yields.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, as oil prices head south, investors have begun pulling out of Russia. The dollar surged to RUB32.125, one more \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to fall back to almost the start-of-the-year exchange rate. Investors had bet on Russia as oil prices went up earlier this year and on the hope of Vladimir Putin winning the country's election.\par \par \uc2 -By Prabha Natarajan, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2468; prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com; @djfxtrader\par \par \uc2 --Stephen L. Bernard contributed to this article. [ 25-05-12 1911GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120525e85p000ye\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
