\par\par \b \uc2 Brazilian Real Opens Stronger As  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2  Change Outlook\b0\par\par\uc2 By Paul Kiernan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Mai 2012\par 15:07\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real opened moderately stronger against the dollar Thursday, as investors bet that vigorous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week could stem outflows from local financial markets.\par \par \uc2 Around 8:45 a.m. EDT, the real was quoted at BRL2.0355 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, compared with BRL2.0419 at Wednesday's close.\par \par \uc2 With the real sliding in recent weeks to its lowest values against the dollar in three years and local authorities appearing satisfied--or at least unconcerned--about a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , investors have grown increasingly nervous.\par \par \uc2 Recent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed a massive $5.2 billion in net withdrawals by foreign investors from Brazil during the May 1-18 period, and the exchange rate on Wednesday shot up to BRL2.10 in intraday trades.\par \par \uc2 RBC said in a note Thursday that the real's slide past BRL2.05 triggered its stop-loss in a bet that the real would appreciate over the Colombian peso. RBC cited a "lack of a more vigorous and timely defense" of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the real's decline.\par \par \uc2 But after remaining largely on the sidelines in recent weeks--with officials arguing that the real was behaving no differently from other emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the context of Europe's debt crisis--the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dived head-first into the market on Tuesday and Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The bank auctioned the equivalent of $3.5 billion in swap contract on Tuesday and Wednesday, allowing investors to exchange paper linked to domestic interest rates for contracts indexed to the U.S. dollar. The real responded immediately, recovering from intraday lows against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Reginaldo Siaca, manager of Sao Paulo's Advanced brokerage, said he thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was strong enough to send a message to the market that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is willing and able to contain volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 But investors caution that with the possibility of Greece exiting the euro zone, Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which traded as strong as BRL1.70 earlier this year, is unlikely to see a meaningful appreciation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 -By Paul Kiernan, Dow Jones Newswires; (+55)11-3544-7074, paul.kiernan@dowjones.com [ 05-24-12 0907ET ]\par \par \uc2 1836 5053 5076   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120524e85o0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
