\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real flat after cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Walter Brandimarte   \par \uc2 456 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 2012\par 17:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 2nd \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap auction, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, May 22 (Reuters) - Brazil's real trimmed losses o n T uesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has slumped about 17 percent since the beginning of March.\par \par \uc2 Other Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded flat to weaker as investors remained skeptical that an informal meeting of European leaders this week would yield much progress in tackling Europe's debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 The real , weighed by economic concerns at home and abroad, fell nearly 1 percent to more than 2.06 per dollar when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered to sell about $2.5 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps. Not all contracts were sold right away, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a second auction when the real was sliding again.\par \par \uc2 The two consecutive \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which have a market impact similar to the sale of dollars in the futures market, led some traders to believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was setting an informal ceiling around 2.05 reais per dollar for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We can say that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not comfortable with the real at 2.06 per dollar," said Alfredo Barbutti, chief economist at BGC Liquidez brokerage in Sao Paulo. He noted that the bank also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday when the real neared the same level.\par \par \uc2 "I don't believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is worried about the impact of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on inflation at this moment. This is just to put the house in order," he added.\par \par \uc2 The real immediately erased losses after the announcement and seesawed near the unchanged mark afterward as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a combined $2.2 billion worth of swaps in the two auctions. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last traded at 2.0474 per dollar, little changed from Monday's close.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday sold \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps to support the real for the first time in nearly seven months, but did not change the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's depreciation trend.\par \par \uc2 Investors have been revising down their estimates for the real as a recent string of disappointing economic data in Brazil suggested the government may resort to lower interest rates and a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the economy.\par \par \uc2 Putting additional pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Finance Minister Guido Mantega o n T uesday repeated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently stands at "a more favorable place for Brazil's competitiveness."\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso lost 0.44 percent to 13.7575 per dollar and the Chilean peso was flat at 505.60.\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Natalia Cacioli in Sao Paulo; Editing by Andrew Hay and Dan Grebler)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120525e85m000z9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
