\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Slightly Weaker As Market Tests  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 397 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 2012\par 15:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Real opens at BRL2.0462/dlr, vs BRL2.0444/dlr Monday\par \par \uc2 --Many investors see BRL2.05 as trigger for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 --Market could turn more volatile ahead of European summit\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real weakened slightly in early trading Tuesday, with many investors expecting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  later in the session.\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL2.0462 to the dollar early in the session, weaker against the Monday close of BRL2.0444, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 "It looks like the market is going to test government appetite for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Olvidio Soares, a trader at Sao Paulo's Interbolsa brokerage.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market last Friday with a sale of swap contracts. The contracts allow investors to exchange paper linked to interest rates for contracts indexed to the U.S. dollar. By increasing the market's ability to hedge against the dollar, the swap auctions tend to relieve pressure against the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Traders said eventual \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Tuesday could come in the form of another swap auction or in the form of direct sales of dollars to the market through a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction.\par \par \uc2 Traders agreed that BRL2.05 will prove a crucial barrier for the real.\par \par \uc2 "If the real weakens to BRL2.05, and there is no government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , then you could see a swift move to BRL2.06 or BRL2.07," said Soares.\par \par \uc2 Volatility in the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is also linked to the persistent European debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 "I continue to be very worried about Europe," said Paulo Faria-Tavares, managing partner at Sao Paulo's PTX Lending consultants. "The situation there could produce a dire outcome."\par \par \uc2 European leaders are due to meet this week. The meeting is expected to focus on French proposals for continent-wide stimulus. The leaders are also expected to reinforce appeals for debt-burdened Greece to remain within the euro zone.\par \par \uc2 "The Brazilian market is likely to remain nervous as the summit unfolds," said Soares.\par \par \uc2 Nerves were also frayed Tuesday by news that Fitch Ratings downgraded Japan's sovereign rating to A-plus, with a negative outlook, citing continued debt-management problems in the Asian country.\par \par \uc2 -By Tom Murphy, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7090; brazil@dowjones.com [ 22-05-12 1306GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120522e85m000v4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
